flowchart TD
    Start([User Initiates Magic Rough Cut]) --> CheckActiveSeq{Active Sequence Detected?}
    CheckActiveSeq -- No --> PromptSelect[Show Empty State: 'Please open and select a sequence in Premiere Pro']
    CheckActiveSeq -- Yes --> GetMetadata[Extract Sequence Metadata: Name, Frame Rate, Timecode, Audio Channels, Clips]

    GetMetadata --> ModeSelect{Selected Mode}
    ModeSelect -->|Auto Edit| FlagAuto[Set Execution Mode: Direct Apply on New Sequence]
    ModeSelect -->|Review Edit| FlagReview[Set Execution Mode: Populate Review Queue]

    FlagAuto --> ExtractAudio[Stage 1: Audio Extraction via FFmpeg Neon / Clip Stitching]
    FlagReview --> ExtractAudio

    ExtractAudio --> Transcribe[Stage 2: Speech Recognition - MLX-Whisper / Groq Cloud]
    Transcribe --> AlignWords[Stage 3: Word-Level Forced Alignment - Wav2Vec2 CTC / DTW]

    AlignWords --> ParallelAnalysis[Stage 4: Parallel Intelligence Engines]
    
    subgraph IntelligenceEngines["Parallel Signal & Content Analysis"]
        VAD["Silence Detection\nSilero VAD + Adaptive RMS"]
        Filler["Filler & Stutter Detection\nDictionary + Context Model"]
        Takes["Repeated Take Detection\nSemantic Similarity + Take Ranking"]
    end

    ParallelAnalysis --> VAD
    ParallelAnalysis --> Filler
    ParallelAnalysis --> Takes

    VAD --> ConflictResolution[Stage 5: Cut Decision Harmonizer & Boundary Padding]
    Filler --> ConflictResolution
    Takes --> ConflictResolution

    ConflictResolution --> FilterOverlap{Overlapping Cuts or Speech Incursions?}
    FilterOverlap -- Yes --> ResolvePadding[Enforce Pre-roll/Post-roll Padding & Protect Active Speech]
    FilterOverlap -- No --> BuildCutPlan[Stage 6: Generate Atomic Cut Decisions & Edit Decision List]

    BuildCutPlan --> BranchMode{Execution Mode}

    BranchMode -->|Review Edit| PushQueue[Push to Review Queue UI]
    PushQueue --> UserReview[User Inspects, Previews, Accepts/Rejects]
    UserReview --> UserApprove[User Clicks 'Apply Approved Edits']
    UserApprove --> CloneSeq[Stage 7: Clone Original Sequence via UXP]

    BranchMode -->|Auto Edit| CloneSeq

    CloneSeq --> ExecuteEdits[Stage 8: Execute Timeline Cuts via SequenceEditor / Batch Actions]
    ExecuteEdits --> VerifySync{Verify Sync & Track Integrity}
    VerifySync -- Failed --> Rollback[Trigger Safe Rollback / Report Discrepancy]
    VerifySync -- Passed --> GenReport[Stage 9: Generate Rough Cut Summary Report]
    GenReport --> Finish([Rough Cut Ready for Inspection])
